---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import welcomePhoto from '../assets/2B3A8794.jpg'
---

<section id="welcome" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 md:px-10 md:py-32">
	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-14 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-8">
		<Image
			src={welcomePhoto}
			alt="Meghna resting her head on Akash's shoulder as they look out at the Chicago skyline at dusk"
			widths={[480, 800, 1200]}
			sizes="(min-width: 768px) 40vw, 100vw"
			class="mx-auto aspect-3/4 w-full max-w-sm object-cover object-[50%_60%] md:col-span-5 md:max-w-none"
		/>

		<div class="text-center md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7">
			<p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-brass">
				Welcome to our wedding site
			</p>
			<h2
				class="mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-light leading-tight text-deep md:text-5xl"
			>
				One day in <em class="italic text-rose">Kerala</em>
			</h2>

			<div class="mx-auto my-10 h-px w-16 bg-brass"></div>

			<div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
				<p>
					On June 27, 2027, we&rsquo;re getting married in Trivandrum: a morning
					at the temple, then lunch by the sea with the people we love
					most. We&rsquo;re so excited, and we can&rsquo;t wait to
					celebrate with you.
				</p>
				<p>
					Everything you need to plan is below, and we&rsquo;ll keep
					this page updated as details are finalized.
				</p>
			</div>

			<p class="mt-12 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/50">
				With love,
			</p>
			<p class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl italic text-deep">
				Meghna <span class="text-brass">&amp;</span> Akash
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
